BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Sonoma County APA Pool League
UID:event_316688647@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261010T053403Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261013T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261013T210000
SUMMARY:Sonoma County APA pool league
DESCRIPTION:Apa Pool League\nLearn the game of pool\, or\, polish your ski
 lls. Come join a team and compete for cash\, patches\, trophies and a chan
 ce to go to Las Vegas to play in the National Pool Tournaments. Beginners 
 are also needed for current teams.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/apa-pool-league/events/316688647/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260924T021037Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260924T021037Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Sonoma County APA Pool League
UID:event_316704037@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261010T053403Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261014T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261014T220000
SUMMARY:APA Pool League - New Session Starting
DESCRIPTION:Apa Pool League\nJoin us for a thrilling APA Pool League Game 
 Night where we come together to showcase our skills in billiards and pool.
  Whether you're a seasoned player or a beginner looking to learn the ropes
 \, this event is perfect for pool enthusiasts of all levels. Test your str
 ategy\, improve your game\, and enjoy a friendly competition with fellow m
 embers of the APA Pool League. If you are looking for a fun night out to h
 ave fun\, meet people\, and play pool. Sonoma County APA is perfect for yo
 u. You don't have to be a pool shark to join. Beginners wanted. We are the
  worlds largest pool league and a fun league that competes once a week. Te
 ams that win\, will receive a fully paid trip to Las Vegas to compete in t
 he World Pool Championships. You can either join an existing team or creat
 e your own. Creating a team is very easy. You can grab 2 friends and have 
 them bring 2 of their friends. Friends\, co-workers\, or family. Everyone 
 can play and anyone can win. 5-8 players on a team. If you cant create a t
 eam\, come join an existing team. We have divisions that play on Tuesday\,
  Wednesday\, or Thursday nights. If you need more information\, please rea
 ch out to me. 707-687-8757 (Max)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/apa-pool-league/events/316704037/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260925T021949Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260925T021949Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Sonoma County APA Pool League
UID:event_316704064@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261010T053403Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261014T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261014T220000
SUMMARY:APA Pool League Game Night Extravaganza!
DESCRIPTION:Apa Pool League\nJoin us for an exciting evening of pool at th
 e APA Pool League Night Extravaganza! Whether you are a seasoned pro or a 
 beginner\, this event is open to all players looking to have a fun time. G
 et ready to showcase your billiards skills\, learn new strategies\, and me
 et fellow pool enthusiasts. This is the perfect opportunity to socialize\,
  enjoy friendly competition\, and immerse yourself in the thrilling world 
 of pool leagues.\n\nDon't miss out on the chance to be part of the Apa Poo
 l League community as we come together for a night filled with games\, cam
 araderie\, and good times. Whether you're interested in testing your skill
 s\, learning from others\, or simply having a blast\, this event has somet
 hing for everyone. Grab your cue\, chalk up your pool stick\, and get read
 y for an unforgettable gaming experience with APA Pool League!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/apa-pool-league/events/316704064/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260925T022009Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260925T022009Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
